Package: SCdetMito
Title: Reference-Aware Adaptive Mitochondrial Quality Control for
        Single-Cell RNA-Seq
Version: 1.4.5
Authors@R: 
    person(
        given = "Silu",
        family = "Hu",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "husilu0902@gmail.com"
    )
Description: Provides reference-aware and sample-aware adaptive mitochondrial
    quality control for single-cell RNA-seq data. The framework constructs
    retained-cell profiles across candidate mitochondrial cutoffs, quantifies
    interval-specific cell loss, estimates multiple interpretable cutoff
    candidates, integrates literature-informed reference cutoffs, and supports
    multi-sample QC strategies, benchmarking, sensitivity analysis, cutoff
    stability and confidence reporting, explicit no-call states, secondary QC
    concordance checks, warning generation, and provenance tracking for Seurat
    workflows.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ggplot2, reshape2, rlang, Seurat
Suggests: DoubletFinder, knitr, markdown, rmarkdown, SeuratData, testthat (>=
        3.0.0)
